### 3.6 Complexity summary

| Component | Cost |
|---|---|
| Reachability / relabel | `O(V+E)` |
| Contraction iteration | `O(rounds · E)`; `rounds` = contraction-tree depth |
| Certificate construction | `O(V+E)` |
| `BruteForce` (tests only) | `O(2^{|R|} · |R|²)` |
| `Verify` | `O((V+E) log V)` (laminar LCA) |

